WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.000
One panorama across three differently sized screens.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.300
Add your panorama to the image library.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Click Auto-arrange to position the image.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:16.200
Open Screens and enable Real screen size.
Adjust the gap between the panels if needed.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:22.000
Open the screen preview before applying the wallpaper.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:27.900
The horizon stays aligned across the screens.
